{end_of_grid}
And [Am]while we are [Am]playing,
The [C]candles are [G]burning [C]low. [E7]
[Am]One for each [Dm]night, they [Am]shed a sweet [Dm]light
To [Am]remind us of [E7]days long a[Am]go.
[Am]One for [Dm]each night, they [Am]shed a sweet [Dm]light
To re[Am]mind us of [E7]days long a[Am]go.
{end_of_verse}

